	(gr_text "WakeBand flex rev A, layout hand-off. Unfolded view, all SMT parts top side.\nPod about 23.5 x 40 mm. Islands 36 x 21.5 mm; the 30 mm cell bay ends 0.5 mm before the antenna shadow.\nStackup: 2-layer adhesiveless PI 25 um, 18 um Cu, coverlay, ENIG, about 0.12 mm.\nStiffeners on the bottom (User.2): FR4 0.4 under island A and under island B's LRA / dock strip\n(windows >= 0.3 mm around the B-side pads TP201/202/501/502). No steel stiffeners.\nBend zone (User.3, 9 mm neck): no vias or parts, every trace one straight segment along x, R >= 1.2 mm.\nVias only on stiffened areas, >= 0.5 mm from a stiffener edge. Trace/space >= 0.1 mm.\nConfirm with JLCPCB which User layers they read for stiffeners before ordering."
		(at 96 124 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "a163fd84-9a33-4eb5-8649-b703cd695b8a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.7 0.7)
				(thickness 0.083999)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "Fold line x=136"
		(at 133 114.4 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "b672a558-c187-4599-a4ab-2e37c23cb914")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.096)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "CELL 12 x 30 (island B, B side)"
		(at 141 100 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "dbac2e43-a797-4ca0-8b02-237981cd803a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.096)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "LRA 8 mm (B side)"
		(at 141.6 115 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "52ddbd5e-358c-4f33-be05-516baf715f5c")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.096)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FOLD / ASSEMBLY ORIENTATION (fold line x = 136, island B folds UNDER island A):\n- Island A F side (all SMT parts) faces UP, away from the wrist.\n- Island B F side faces DOWN to the case floor: dock pads J601 face the dock.\n- Cell and LRA mount on island B's B side (inner face, between the islands):\n  cell tabs solder to TP201 (+) / TP202 (-), LRA leads to TP501 (+) / TP502 (-), all on B.Cu;\n  LRA tapes onto the FR4 stiffener in the 8 mm motor strip beside the cell.\n- All SMT parts are on F (single-sided assembly); B-side pads are hand-soldered after the fold."
		(at 96 136 0)
		(layer "Dwgs.User")
		(uuid "7ef26b50-0f83-4a79-9362-b6391f2a8ee2")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
